  "slug": "red-curry-chicken-with-basil",
  "title": "Red Curry Chicken with Basil",
  "blurb": "Tender chicken breast simmered in a fragrant coconut curry with sweet peppers and fresh basil.",
  "steps": [
    "Cut the chicken breasts into bite-sized pieces and slice the onion into thin wedges.",
    "Deseed the red pepper and cut it into strips.",
    "Heat the oil in a large pan over medium-high heat and fry the curry paste for one minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the chicken pieces and cook for five minutes, stirring occasionally, until lightly browned.",
    "Add the onion and red pepper, then pour in the coconut milk and bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Stir in the fish sauce and brown sugar, then simmer for twelve minutes until the chicken is cooked through and the sauce has thickened slightly.",
    "Tear the basil leaves and stir them through just before serving."
